/V (SPRINT 1 GOAL\012Record and correct daily attendance\054 distinguish absence types and retrieve attendance history in the shared router\056\012\012SELECTED NEW FUNCTIONALITY\012M10\055FR\05501 \055 Record attendance \055 \0431\072 enter course ID\054 student ID\054 date\054 status and optional notes\056 Save one mark per\012course\057student\057date\056 Re\055saving corrects that mark\056 Persist records in local SQLite across restart\056\012\012M10\055FR\05502 \055 Attendance history \055 \0432\072 list newest date first\073 filter by exact course\057student IDs and inclusive start\057end\012dates\073 show a useful empty state\056 Provide both HTML and JSON history\056\012\012M10\055FR\05503 \055 Excused\057unexcused absences \055 \0431\054 \0433\072 support Present\054 Absent \055 excused and Absent \055 unexcused\056\012Reject other statuses\056\012\012TRACEABILITY NOTE\012These are proposed local IDs\054 not verified class SRS numbers\056 They map to the first three Module 10 bullets on page 3\012of the supplied project brief\056 Copy\057map them into the collaborative SRS with Sprint Iteration 1 before final submission \055\012\0434\056\012\012ACCEPTANCE \057 TESTING\012Validate IDs \055 1\05550 characters\054 real dates and notes \055 up to 300 characters\056 Do not create duplicate daily marks\056\012Escape displayed input\056 Verify file persistence\054 form save\057correction\054 filtered history\054 invalid input and shared\055router\012integration\056 Record real regression results\056\012\012IMPLEMENTATION\012JavaScript \053 Elysia \053 Bun native SQLite\073 entry index\056js at \05710\055attendance\056 No shared file or package changes\056 Current\012candidate passes 25 module tests and 81 full\055repo tests\056\012\012DEFERRED\012\0435\072 identity roles and enrolled course\057student validation\056 Sample IDs only until integrated\056\012\0436\072 M10\055FR\05504 participation\054 M10\055FR\05505 reports\054 M10\055FR\05506 statistics\056\012\012SUBMISSION \057 TEAM WORK\012Submit completed Input and Release Note PDFs plus actual Doxygen HTML ZIP\056 Finish peer review\054 class SRS\012update and team demo\056 Do not claim those activities before they occur\056)
>>
endobj
